sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Sender
    participant B as Receiver
    participant Registry as Receiver connection registry

    A->>A: Generate random 16-byte nonce
    A->>B: VERSIONS
    A->>B: PRIORITY(nonce)
    B->>Registry: Store priority for this connection
    Registry->>Registry: Compare with existing connections

    alt Existing connection is preferred
        Registry->>A: Interrupt new outgoing session
    else New connection is preferred
        Registry->>Registry: Interrupt old outgoing session
    else Neither connection strictly wins
        Registry->>Registry: Retain current connection state
    end